      "url": "https://manage.firstenroll.com/information/product.cfm?page=44347&id=974358",
      "v": "TERMS AND CONDITIONS - BWA MEMBERSHIP. FirstEnroll charges 'on behalf of the Business Workers of America, Inc.' Statements show 'FirstEnroll'. Payments falling on a weekend or holiday may be executed on the prior business day. The authorization remains in effect until cancelled IN WRITING, with at least 15 days notice before the next billing date. An ENROLLMENT FEE is charged, described as 'the cost of the administrators who assist you with your application for membership in the Association'. Client checkboxes include: 'You understand this Membership nor the Hospital Indemnity Insurance provide minimum essential benefits under the Affordable Care Act, is not a substitute for major medical insurance coverage, nor is it intended to replace existing Health Insurance'; 'You attest that you are currently working'; and an agreement to call (732) 876-9733 immediately if no email arrives within 24 hours. Refund: review the membership booklet and supporting documents in the Member Portal within 30 days of the confirmation email; if not happy, contact customer service within 30 days for a full refund - ENROLLMENT FEES ARE NOT REFUNDED.",
